{"id":"gpu-ray-tracer","title":"GPU ray tracer","subtitle":"real-time reflections","author":null,"source":"examples/gpu-ray-tracer.asm","profile":"gpu-1","format":"RGB888","engines":["CPU","GPU"],"payloadBytes":1652,"cartridgeBytes":1684,"cartridgeSha256":"a2400353425863f91a830133b1baa22e951dce67e28d89509b47022ed9414f10","rgbaSha256":"30f1be5e66aa919ee43c7f8e3e12cb70223133ef0cbd98bd39016eb269fa4fd7","wasmSha256":"8fbac8f8ef7771c0522d05b2d928c760b52075b21c513f9546617184dded0780","frames":360,"seconds":6,"firstVisibleFrame":3,"halted":false,"gpuDispatches":359,"gpuBudgetPercent":98.79638671875,"spuBlocks":0,"audioPeak":0,"lines":365,"instructions":287,"notes":["GPU-1 Whitted ray tracer. One invocation traces a ray into RGB888 output.","Three primary/reflected surface hits, with finite point-light shadow rays","from every surface (the floor and all three spheres). All scene traversal,","normals, material selection, lighting, and reflection live in this kernel.","The CPU owns only dispatch, a small triangular light animation, and page flips."],"excerpt":".profile gpu-1\n.equ GPU, 0xf3000\n.equ VIDEO, 0xf5000\n.equ FB_A, 0x10000\n.equ FB_B, 0x1e100\n.equ RGB_BYTES, 57600\n.equ PIXEL_SHIFT, 0\n.entry start\nstart:\n    li r1, FB_A              ; render target, then displayed page\n    li r2, FB_B              ; other page\n    li r3, GPU\n    li r4, kernel\n    sw r4, 0(r3)\n    li r4, kernel_end-kernel\n    sw r4, 4(r3)\n    li r4, 160\n    li r10, PIXEL_SHIFT","description":null,"scenes":null,"poster":"gpu-ray-tracer.png","gif":"gpu-ray-tracer.gif","gifFps":20,"gifFrames":120,"keyframes":[{"file":"gpu-ray-tracer-k00.png","frame":3},{"file":"gpu-ray-tracer-k01.png","frame":54},{"file":"gpu-ray-tracer-k02.png","frame":105},{"file":"gpu-ray-tracer-k03.png","frame":156},{"file":"gpu-ray-tracer-k04.png","frame":207},{"file":"gpu-ray-tracer-k05.png","frame":258},{"file":"gpu-ray-tracer-k06.png","frame":309},{"file":"gpu-ray-tracer-k07.png","frame":360}],"bytes":"gpu-ray-tracer-bytes.png","payloadHex":"","audio":null}